  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Johnsonville Gari Production and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will benefit the forty-five members of JWFMCS of whom 40 are women. The group produces cassava and with this grant will begin processing it into gari. , Description: The project will fund technical and management capacity building, and provide for the construction and operation of a small cassava processing facility.</narrative>
  </description>
